flowchart LR
  Source[Endpoint / Network Event] --> Detect[Wazuh Detection Rule]
  Detect --> Alert[Normalized Security Alert]
  Alert --> Route{SOAR trigger?}
  Route -->|No| Analyst[Dashboard / Analyst Review]
  Route -->|Yes| Shuffle[Shuffle Workflow]
  Shuffle --> Enrich[Enrichment & Context]
  Enrich --> Decide{Response policy}
  Decide -->|Observe| Ticket[Case / Notification]
  Decide -->|Contain| Action[Approved Response Action]
  Action --> Verify[Verify outcome]
  Ticket --> Close[Close / Tune Detection]
  Verify --> Close
  Close --> GitLab[Version rule / workflow change in GitLab]
